# Sitecore (Pages Router)

- **Data:** `getStaticProps` / `getServerSideProps` in `src/pages/[[...path]].tsx`; `extractPath(context)` + `context.locale`
- **Client:** single `SitecoreClient` in `src/lib/sitecore-client.ts`
- **Preview:** `context.preview` + `context.previewData` → `getPreview` / `getDesignLibraryData`
- **Fields:** use `<Text>`, `<RichText>`, `<Image>`, `<Link>`; validate before render
- **Map:** `.sitecore/component-map.ts` auto-generated from `src/components/`
- **Config:** env-only in `sitecore.config.ts`

